<title>USA: LumaNet names Don Goree president.</title>
<headline>LumaNet names Don Goree president.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>LumaNet Corp said Tuesday it named Don Goree president and director.</p>
<p>A company spokesman said Goree, formerly of Compass Rose Merchant Bank, replaces John Christensen, who became LumaNet's chairman, a new position.</p>
<p>((New York Newsdesk 212 859 1610))</p>
